{"v3_4df3e8a014d37b953b494169":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます☾⋆ ࣪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮城県出身 21歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四期生の山川宇衣（やまかわうい）です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「どうでもいい連絡は、\nどうでもいい相手にはしないもの」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、\nどこかで見たか聞いたかしたこの言葉を\nたまーに思い返しては"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かになぁ、そうだよなぁ\nってなるのを繰り返してます🫢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと特別なことではないんだろうけど\nなんでか妙にぐさりと刺さって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく抜けないままでいるので\nついにここにも書いてみました…✉️🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでもいいことを話したくなる相手がいるって\nきっとすごく幸せなことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思ったら、自分って幸せ者だなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしもみなさんにとっての\nそんな相手がわたしだったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この感覚が\nわたしからの一方通行じゃなかったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと幸せなんだけどなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"😗😗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなことも、どうでもいい話でも\nなんでも聞かせてね ֊  ̫ ֊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだなぁ、たとえば\n「夜ご飯決めて」とか、結構すきです🫢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会える時間が終わってからも、\nわたしとの会話を思い出して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後の時間も一緒に過ごしてくれるんだって嬉しくなるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてわたしも同じように\nバイバイした後のみなさんのことを想像できるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがすごく嬉しいーー🥲🍚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしがこれ！って言ったのを用意して\n美味しく食べてくれるところを想像したら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなの愛おしすぎる、くーー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いにお互いのこと考えてるんだから\nそれはもう一緒にご飯食べてるようなものです🍚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎはなに話そうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回みなさんに会えたのは\nツアーが終わってから初めてのこと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして少し久しぶりのことでもあったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーの感想やイベントのお話をしながら\n一緒に夏の思い出を振り返ったり🌻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、お披露目しようと持っていった\nかわいいめがねを褒めてもらったり…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobWpsl9X.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobTLuhr4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"褒められたくてずっとかけてた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎀"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobZXxnIB.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","te