break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えてくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/04/27/7643296/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前学校の行き帰りに\n4人も私に道を尋ねて来たの(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頼られてる感がすごく\n嬉しくて、張り切って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「えっとですねぇ...\nこの道をまっすぐ行って〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか知ってます風に説明したけど\n心の中ではちょこっと\n\"私、超〜方向音痴だけど\nいいのかな？\"と思いながら。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもね、最後に道聞かれた時は\n私自身も迷子になってる最中で\n頭の中ゴチャゴチャだった(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんちゃんと\n目的地ついてることを\n祈るよぉ〜(っTωT)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"方向音痴が道案内するって\nなんとも迷惑な話です(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お！もう一個街での出来事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てくてく歩いていると\nいきなり後ろから\n「すみません！」と声をかけられ\nなんだろ？と振り向くと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「腹黒いんですか？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりに急にしかも一言だけ\n腹黒いんですか？って聞かれたから\nびっくり(OωO )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん腹黒くないですよ♪と\n事実を述べました(σ･ω･)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/04/27/7643296/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いちごにチュー♡